<span id="S2.T1.5.6.6.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S2.T1.5.6.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Conversational VQA, Visual Reasoning</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
